wwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): "proposition": { "predicate": "url", "object": "https://grist.org/extreme-weather/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster/" }, "time": {ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lf-UfNyrzwKHthUe8YoJE37XOl2eaNjhfdxtU-pORYwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyaPrior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): "provenance": { "witness": "collapse-climate", "citation": "https://grist.org/extreme-weather/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster/" }, "status": "supported"ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KP8npLEF3zFTLp1N77Et2D25p_KeR5BxyBw5HH_ijpMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkysPrior research (store/collapse-climate/the-world-cup-is-one-wildfire-away-from-an-air-quality-disaster.json, ni:///sha-256;iDiqouP2UT0HsNijQh8meYuuOrwwfaoYI-YO0GWBKMw): "proposition": { "predicate": "summary", "object": "Last month, nearly a dozen wildfires erupted across southern California, sending plumes of smoke and particulate matter into the air. Public health officials in Los Angeles issued a multiday air quality advisory for the county, warning of â€œpotential direct smoke impactâ€ and advising everyone who could see or smell smoke to â€œavoid unnecessary outdoor exposure and to limit physical exertion.â€ The red zone on the map included Los Angeles Stadium â€”&nbsp;also known as SoFi Stadium â€” one of the venues for the World Cup, soccerâ€™s marquee event, which begins on Thursday. Between June 12 and July 10, Los Angeles will host eight games and is expec...ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;016ABwTfKin5I04EYay_8z0ZCGGz-k7DKGa6EO9BNk0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstard