yXBXo0pX72__PlIpiwPQDC4elNr3DzpBCIiclVz23SEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky)Prior research (content/posts/super-bowl-libra-rugpull-crisis.md, ni:///sha-256;B5bdUjaby2ux4g1DcYxtg4FObbMeTc7sDy1yQ1ihIQ4): keywords: ["$LIBRA"] categories: ["Economy"] tags: ["$LIBRA", "Barstool Sports", "Dave Portnoy", "Javier Milei", "rugpull", "scam"] references: - type: "article-newspaper"ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lHoVEQqadqLO5vGGNm0tNfC_2zrAhYbh1lJVjx5AC-cƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky"Prior research (content/posts/super-bowl-libra-rugpull-crisis.md, ni:///sha-256;B5bdUjaby2ux4g1DcYxtg4FObbMeTc7sDy1yQ1ihIQ4): As the fallout continues, one key question remains largely unexamined: **where did the initial liquidity that fueled $LIBRAâ€™s meteoric rise come from?** And hereâ€™s where things take an unexpected turnâ€”Barstool Sports, its **Super Bowl betting operation**, and its outspoken founder **Dave Portnoy** may be closer to the story than anyone initially realized. ## The $LIBRA Collapse: A Timeline That Doesnâ€™t Add Upƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;o7Bwu866SJaCx6cyCTqd1nVqeeJbeinmLFc-55uCITAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyøPrior research (content/posts/super-bowl-libra-rugpull-crisis.md, ni:///sha-256;B5bdUjaby2ux4g1DcYxtg4FObbMeTc7sDy1yQ1ihIQ4): And hereâ€™s where things take an unexpected turnâ€”Barstool Sports, its **Super Bowl betting operation**, and its outspoken founder **Dave Portnoy** may be closer to the story than anyone initially realized. ## The $LIBRA Collapse: A Timeline That Doesnâ€™t Add Up To understand why this isnâ€™t just a run-of-the-mill crypto scandal, we need to look at the sequence of events:ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2IyQVvDPnMBavNR1rLMtqelc4A_Y0Wp1D_iUOC5MfMYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyÈPrior research (content/posts/super-bowl-libra-rugpull-crisis.md, ni:///sha-256;B5bdUjaby2ux4g1DcYxtg4FObbMeTc7sDy1yQ1ihIQ4): ## Dave Portnoy, Barstool, and the Role of Super Bowl Betting Liquidity Enter **Dave Portnoy**â€”a man who has made a career of blending sports media, gambling, and financial speculation. His **Barstool Sportsbook** was one of the major players in **Super Bowl betting**, a sector that saw billions of dollars in wagers this year.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Kvq8VeGQRk1rYRFwaIBXw84nPsrADmoXwaA9rnMLwJ0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyqPrior research (content/posts/super-bowl-libra-rugpull-crisis.md, ni:///sha-256;B5bdUjaby2ux4g1DcYxtg4FObbMeTc7sDy1yQ1ihIQ4): Enter **Dave Portnoy**â€”a man who has made a career of blending sports media, gambling, and financial speculation. His **Barstool Sportsbook** was one of the major players in **Super Bowl betting**, a sector that saw billions of dollars in wagers this year. We know Portnoy was involved in $LIBRAâ€™s promotionâ€”he admitted to receiving **six million $LIBRA tokens**, though he later claimed to have returned them after realizing the promotional arrangement was less transparent than he had hoped.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;o5BWwPY_0znNVmoYN5X4V9NPNfQC8tktbDzzItYlBcYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky8Prior research (content/posts/super-bowl-libra-rugpull-crisis.md, ni:///sha-256;B5bdUjaby2ux4g1DcYxtg4FObbMeTc7sDy1yQ1ihIQ4): The bigger question is: **Did Barstool Sports use liquidity from its cut as a sportsbook to artificially inflate the $LIBRA token before insiders cashed out?** Hereâ€™s why this matters:ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xfnRNyoVvUFM-prN-unyGd_byzA2mlFZo-HBihgeLeMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky9Prior research (content/editorial-context/pipeline-context.json, ni:///sha-256;xK2sLBlTxHEH0tI6eKQdW8CUkh0Gcj-JE6bfVwqeC74): "sourceId": "prior-art/agentic-newsroom", "digest": "sha256:f2efbcf0cf58ca651b4be4dc11899fef3ce7a95a003a10309126673bb0c99537", "content": "---\ntitle: Accountable Agentic Newsrooms Research Agenda\ndescription: A research agenda for warrant-preserving editorial infrastructure, where evidence, attribution, authority, judgment, genre, legal risk, correction, and accountability remain distinguishable as claims move through humans, agents, tools, prose, metadata, feeds, and downstream summaries. Frames the problem as controlled delegation rather than autonomous publication, names fifteen research questions (editorial judgment as gates not functions, authority graphs, source-power modeling, mo...ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;sNnTER_CeuVsUt4q_-jYhraeoygk5AB24L6JO-lVLScƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyFPrior research (store/collapse-decolonization/the-meaning-of-omar-artan.json, ni:///sha-256;AWroBu3zxFggg9zntYLtOxEoxOTqI6JK-q7PPTdWca0): "proposition": { "predicate": "summary", "object": "Omar Artan was already a hero before he came back to Somalia this week after being denied entry to the United States for the World Cup. Long before the controversy, he had become a household name in the country. As one former sports official told me, a warm welcome was guaranteed whenever he eventually returned to Mogadishu. But the decision by US immigration authorities to turn him away transformed the meaning of his homecoming. Somali journalists had spent the morning waiting for his flight from Istanbul to land. On the tarmac, a delegation of senior government officials waited patiently alongside us, flags in hand and many already che...ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_VWog